# Normalise every text file to LF in the repository.
#
# core.autocrlf is true on this machine, so without this the working tree and
# the object store disagree about line endings and CI on Linux sees a diff
# against a checkout that looks identical. Pinning it here is cheap now and a
# whole-tree renormalisation later.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Anything git should never touch.
*.zip   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.webp  binary
*.gif   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp3   binary
*.ogg   binary
